        "DisplayName": "Enable DLC Content",
        "Category": "The Riftbreaker:stadia_controller",
        "Subcategory": "Server:dns:1",
        "Description": "Enables the Metal Terror, Into the Dark and Heart of the Swamp DLC for Story campaigns. Players must own every enabled DLC to join a Story campaign. The server cannot enable the DLC individually, only all or none. DLC cannot be removed from a campaign: disabling this only affects new campaigns, and starting a campaign that has no DLC while this is enabled adds the DLC to it permanently. Open campaigns and Survival are not affected",
